        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Palenque</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 226 BCE – c. 799 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">The ruins date from about 226 BCE; the first king of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/city-state">city-state</a> known by name, Kʼuk Balam, began to rule in 431, and he is supposed to have founded the dynasty.</span></div>
